Text | Title | Meaning and what to do
latex and dvipng are needed to typeset an equation | Equation | The programs
 | | that typeset an equation are not installed, so {k:Ctrl-W} cannot show it.
 | | See the prerequisites.
The text of the reading error | Title Page | The title page text could not be
 | | made a document; the reasons are those of Retrieve.
Viewing an equation needs the X11 version | Equation | {k:Ctrl-W} in the
 | | terminal version.
