.h2 The Editor: questions [msg-editor-questions]
.ix Questions, Editor
.ix Yes or No
.ix Confirmation
A question is a box with a list or the words Yes and No.  The default is the
first choice, {k:Esc} is No.
.table 31 29
Question | Asked by
Delete NAME? | Delete (File).  Yes removes the file.
Delete the library entry NAME? | Delete from Library.
Delete the macro Alt-K? | Delete Macro.
Delete the named block format NAME? | Delete Named Block.
Edit the contents of the entry? | Library Entry.  Yes opens the entry text in
 | an editing window.
{c:File does not exist. Create it?} | The start menu of the Editor, a new name was
 | typed.
New document type | New with no template: Structured or Unstructured.
Overwrite old version on disk? | Save, Save Macro Set, Save Library, Export:
 | the file exists.
Replace PATH? | Print Document panel of the Editor: the PDF exists. PATH is
 | the name without its directory.
Replace the entry that has this name? | Copy to Library: the name is used.
Save and quit / Discard changes and quit / Cancel | Quit (Ctrl-Q) with unsaved
 | changes: a list titled Document has unsaved changes.
Save corrected document? | End of the spell check of a file.
The file exists.  Replace it when it is saved? | New with a name that is a
 | file.
The file has changes that were not saved.  Ignore them? | Retrieve (not Insert)
 | and New: the open document has changes.
.end
